createdby: DBot
description: 'Retrieves the bucket policy for an Amazon S3 bucket in a specified AWS
  account and region. Returns the policy document in JSON format including statements
  that define who can access the bucket and what actions they can perform. Use this
  action to investigate cloud posture issues related to S3 bucket policies such as
  overly permissive access grants, public access via wildcard principals, or missing
  condition constraints. REQUIRES: `account_id`, `region`, and the resource identifier.
  When these are not present in user input, resolve them first via `CortexListAssets`
  using the issue''s asset_id or asset_name.'
